ironbase.mcpServers.markdownDescription:
MCP servers to make available to the build agent, keyed by the name their tools are namespaced under (`mcp__<name>__<tool>`). Every MCP call still asks before it runs.

```jsonc
"ironbase.mcpServers": {
  "github": {
    "command": "npx",
    "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],
    "env": { "GITHUB_TOKEN": "..." }
  },
  "docs": { "type": "http", "url": "https://example.com/mcp" }
}
```
